sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Auditor as Security Auditor
    participant Admin as Admin Console
    participant Scanner as Rust Scanner
    participant Chain as Localnet (Anvil)
    
    Auditor->>Admin: Create New Project Engagement
    Admin->>Scanner: Trigger Static Scan on source paths
    Scanner-->>Admin: Return Warnings & Found Rules
    Auditor->>Chain: Run Foundry Fuzz & Exploit Tests
    Chain-->>Auditor: Return Test Exec Log & Gas Metrics
    Auditor->>Admin: Record findings in Board (Critical, High, etc.)
    Auditor->>Admin: Draft Audit Report in Pipeline
    Auditor->>Admin: Export Final PDF to Client
